  "content": {
    "id": "p141-q36-content",
    "type": "question",
    "label": null,
    "prompt": "Let $g(x)$ be an even function, $f(x)$ be any function, and $h(x)=f(g(x))$.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p141-q36-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "Show that $h(-x)=f(g(x))$.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$h(-x)=f(g(-x))=f(g(x))$, since $g$ is even.",
          "worked": "Since $g$ is even, $g(-x)=g(x)$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}h(-x)&=f(g(-x))\\\\h(-x)&=f(g(x)).\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 28
      },
      {
        "id": "p141-q36-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "What can we say about the function $h(x)$?",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$h$ is even.",
          "worked": "Part (a) gives $h(-x)=h(x)$ throughout the composition domain, so $h$ is even.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 12
      },
      {
        "id": "p141-q36-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "Hence, what can we say about the composition of two functions if the ‘inside function’ is even?",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "A composition with an even inner function is even on its domain.",
          "worked": "A composition with an even inner function is even on its domain.\n\nSince $g$ is even, $-x$ belongs to its domain whenever $x$ does, and $g(-x)=g(x)$. Whenever $f(g(x))$ is defined, $f(g(-x))$ is therefore also defined and has the same value. Thus the composition domain is symmetric about zero and $h(-x)=h(x)$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 12
      }
    ]
  },
